From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Paiva <felipe.paiva@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 19:02:12 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] shelf-order

Config/shelf_order.txt picks the order of the system shelves after
Recents and Favorites: "order = classic" (or no file) keeps the order
they were added in, "order = release-year" sorts them by the first
release date of the platform anywhere, oldest first (ADR 0100). The
dates live in one table, RELEASED in shelf_order.rs, and
shelf_order.rs's every_shelf_platform_has_exactly_one_release_date
fails for a shelf platform without a row.
---
